---
// No props — this is a one-off branded card
---

<a href="/notice/" class="notice-card">
  <div class="notice-card__eyebrow">Contemplative Technology</div>
  <img
    src="/images/enso-mark.png"
    alt=""
    class="notice-card__mark"
    width="40"
    height="40"
    loading="lazy"
  />
  <h3 class="notice-card__title">Notice</h3>
  <p class="notice-card__desc">
    Interoceptive awareness training for Apple Watch and iPhone. Two-tier AI
    architecture integrating on-device models for real-time context with Claude
    for longitudinal pattern analysis.
  </p>
  <div class="notice-card__tags">
    <span class="notice-card__tag">SwiftUI</span>
    <span class="notice-card__tag">Apple Watch</span>
    <span class="notice-card__tag">AI Architecture</span>
  </div>
  <span class="notice-card__arrow">&rarr;</span>
</a>

<style>
  .notice-card {
    display: block;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.08);
    border-top: 2px solid transparent;
    border-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #F0AF32, transparent) 1;
    border-image-slice: 1 0 0 0;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    position: relative;
  }

  .notice-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(240, 175, 50, 0.2);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .notice-card__eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #B9691E;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .notice-card__mark {
    display: block;
    width: 40px;
    height: auto;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .notice-card__title {
    font-family: 'Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro', 'Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN', 'Shippori Mincho', serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: #2A2520;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .notice-card__desc {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #7A7068;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .notice-card__tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .notice-card__tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #F0AF32;
    border: 1px solid rgba(240, 175, 50, 0.2);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .notice-card__arrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #B9691E;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2rem;
    right: 2rem;
  }
</style>
